{"archivedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00Z","archivedInDashboard":false,"attachedStylesheets":[],"authorName":"Shawn Peterson","categoryId":1,"contentTypeCategory":4,"createdAt":"2026-06-30T17:22:10.717Z","createdById":"26261533","currentState":"DRAFT","domain":"info.davincilabs.com","featuredImage":"","featuredImageAltText":"","htmlTitle":"Private Label Capsule Supplements | DaVinci Private Label","id":"216186379314","language":"en","layoutSections":{},"metaDescription":"Private label capsule supplements. Vegetarian, gelatin, multi-size, multi-dosage. The most versatile and trusted supplement format. Doctor-formulated.","name":"Private Label - Page - Capsules","pageRedirected":false,"publicAccessRules":[],"publicAccessRulesEnabled":false,"publishDate":"1970-01-01T00:00:00Z","published":false,"slug":"pl-demo-capsules","state":"DRAFT","subcategory":"site_page","templatePath":"Private Label/Templates/Page.html","translations":{},"updatedAt":"2026-06-30T20:04:49.894Z","updatedById":"26261533","url":"https://info.davincilabs.com/pl-demo-capsules","useFeaturedImage":false,"widgetContainers":{"main_content":{"widgets":[{"body":{"html":"<div style=\"background: linear-gradient(rgba(201,219,226,.85), rgba(201,219,226,.85)), url('https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/private-label/DV_PL_HeroBackground_2.jpg') center/cover; padding: 90px 20px; text-align: center;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n    <p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 2px; margin: 0 0 14px;\">PRIVATE LABEL CAPSULES</p>\n    <h1 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 48px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.15; margin: 0 0 22px;\">Launch your supplement line in capsules, customer-ready.</h1>\n    <p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 34px;\">Doctor-formulated supplements available in capsules format, ready to brand as your own and ship to your customers.</p>\n    <a href=\"#get-started\" style=\"display: inline-block; background: #6BA644; color: white; padding: 16px 38px; text-decoration: none; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; border-radius: 4px; letter-spacing: .5px;\">Talk to Our Team</a>\n  </div>\n</div>"},"id":216207156877,"type":"rich_text"},{"body":{"html":"<div style=\"max-width: 850px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 80px 20px 50px;\">\n  <h2 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 32px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.25; margin: 0 0 26px;\">Why brands choose capsules as a supplement format.</h2>\n  <p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 18px;\">Different audiences prefer different delivery formats. Capsules are a category-leading choice when your customers want a specific combination of convenience, dosing precision, and ingredient compatibility.</p><p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 18px;\">With direct access to over 250 doctor-formulated supplements, low minimums, and no set-up fees, you can quickly build a capsules-based product line that fits your audience. Below is what to know about manufacturing capsules for private label: the formulations we offer, the specs available, how we make them, and which health categories benefit most.</p>\n</div>"},"id":216207156878,"type":"rich_text"},{"body":{"html":"<div style=\"background: #c9dbe2; padding: 70px 20px;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n    <p style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 2px; text-align: center; margin: 0 0 14px;\">HOW IT WORKS</p>\n    <h2 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 32px; font-weight: 700; text-align: center; margin: 0 0 50px; line-height: 1.2;\">Get to market faster with a partner who handles the heavy lifting.</h2>\n    <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 40px;\">\n      <div style=\"text-align: left;\">\n      <p style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 56px; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1; margin: 0 0 14px;\">01</p>\n      <p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1.5px; margin: 0 0 14px;\">BUILD YOUR PRODUCT LINE</p>\n      <p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0; opacity: .85;\">Direct access to over 250 doctor-formulated supplements with low minimums and no set-up fees. Choose what fits your audience and your timeline.</p>\n    </div><div style=\"text-align: left;\">\n      <p style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 56px; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1; margin: 0 0 14px;\">02</p>\n      <p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1.5px; margin: 0 0 14px;\">DESIGN YOUR BRAND</p>\n      <p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0; opacity: .85;\">Use your existing logo, customize a new label, or pick from our professional templates. Our in-house design team brings your vision to life.</p>\n    </div><div style=\"text-align: left;\">\n      <p style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 56px; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1; margin: 0 0 14px;\">03</p>\n      <p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1.5px; margin: 0 0 14px;\">START SELLING FAST</p>\n      <p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0; opacity: .85;\">Launch in as little as 3 to 4 weeks after approving your labels. Every product passes rigorous quality assurance before it ships.</p>\n    </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>"},"id":216207156879,"type":"rich_text"},{"body":{"html":"<div style=\"background: #f7f7f6; padding: 70px 20px 30px; text-align: center;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n    <p style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 2px; margin: 0 0 12px;\">ADVANTAGES</p>\n    <h2 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 34px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.2; margin: 0;\">What makes capsules a strong supplement format.</h2>\n    \n  </div>\n</div>"},"id":216207156880,"type":"rich_text"},{"body":{"html":"<div style=\"background: #f7f7f6; padding: 20px 20px 70px;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n    <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 28px;\">\n      <div style=\"background: white; padding: 34px 30px; border-radius: 6px; border-top: 4px solid #6BA644; box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(1,38,56,.06);\">\n      <div style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:56px;height:56px;background:#c9dbe2;border-radius:12px;margin:0 0 18px;\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#012638\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width:28px;height:28px;\"><path d=\"M9 12.75 11.25 15 15 9.75M21 12c0 5.31-3.69 9.76-8.65 10.95a.84.84 0 0 1-.4.05.94.94 0 0 1-.41-.05A11.25 11.25 0 0 1 3 12V5.99c0-.46.31-.87.74-1.05A23.95 23.95 0 0 1 12 3a23.95 23.95 0 0 1 8.26 1.94c.43.18.74.59.74 1.05V12Z\"/></svg></div>\n      <h3 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 19px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 12px;\">The standard for no-fuss supplement delivery</h3>\n      <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;\">Capsules are the most recognized supplement format. Customers swallow them whole, dosing is precise, and the format works across nearly every health category. The right choice when your audience prefers a familiar, low-friction supplement experience.</p>\n    </div><div style=\"background: white; padding: 34px 30px; border-radius: 6px; border-top: 4px solid #6BA644; box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(1,38,56,.06);\">\n      <div style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:56px;height:56px;background:#c9dbe2;border-radius:12px;margin:0 0 18px;\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#012638\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width:28px;height:28px;\"><path d=\"M8.59 12.41a6 6 0 0 1 8.49-8.49l-1.06 1.06m-4.94 11.42L8.59 12.41m6.36 6.36-3.32-3.32m-1.4-1.4a6 6 0 0 0-3.74 1.43A6 6 0 0 0 4 21l1.5-1.5m11.13-11.13L21 4\"/></svg></div>\n      <h3 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 19px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 12px;\">Vegetarian and gelatin options</h3>\n      <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;\">Choose hard-shell gelatin for traditional formulations or HPMC vegetarian capsules for plant-based, kosher, and halal-compatible positioning. Both deliver the same dosing precision and stability.</p>\n    </div><div style=\"background: white; padding: 34px 30px; border-radius: 6px; border-top: 4px solid #6BA644; box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(1,38,56,.06);\">\n      <div style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:56px;height:56px;background:#c9dbe2;border-radius:12px;margin:0 0 18px;\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#012638\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width:28px;height:28px;\"><path d=\"M14.74 9.45A2.6 2.6 0 0 0 17.34 7c0-1.46-1.18-2.4-2.6-2.4-1.4 0-2.6.94-2.6 2.4 0 1.36 1.18 2.45 2.6 2.45ZM17 12h3.43c.7 0 1.27.57 1.27 1.27v3.46c-1.32 0-2.4 1.07-2.4 2.4 0 1.31 1.08 2.4 2.4 2.4v3.47c0 .7-.57 1.27-1.27 1.27H12v-3.43c-1.32 0-2.4-1.08-2.4-2.4 0-1.32 1.08-2.4 2.4-2.4V12h5Z\"/></svg></div>\n      <h3 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 19px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 12px;\">Wide ingredient compatibility</h3>\n      <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;\">Capsules accommodate powders, oils, herbs, and combination formulas that would not work in tablet form. The strongest choice for complex multi-ingredient products and sensitive actives.</p>\n    </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>"},"id":216207156881,"type":"rich_text"},{"body":{"html":"<div style=\"background: white; padding: 70px 20px 30px; text-align: center;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n    <p style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 2px; margin: 0 0 12px;\">SPECIFICATIONS</p>\n    <h2 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 34px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.2; margin: 0;\">Manufacturing specs available for private label capsules.</h2>\n    <p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.65; max-width: 760px; margin: 22px auto 0;\">The most common questions from brand owners are about sizes, materials, fill capacity, and minimums. Here is the short answer for each.</p>\n  </div>\n</div>"},"id":216207156882,"type":"rich_text"},{"body":{"html":"<div style=\"background: white; padding: 80px 20px;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n    <h2 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 32px; font-weight: 700; text-align: center; margin: 0 0 16px;\"></h2>\n    <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 17px; text-align: center; max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto 48px;\"></p>\n    <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 24px;\">\n      <div style=\"background: white; padding: 32px 26px; border-radius: 8px; border-top: 4px solid #012638;\">\n      <div style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 56px; height: 56px; background: #c9dbe2; border-radius: 12px; margin: 0 0 18px;\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#012638\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width:28px;height:28px;\"><path d=\"M21 7.5 12 12m0 0L3 7.5M12 12v9.75m0-9.75 9-4.5M3 7.5l9 4.5M3 7.5v9l9 4.5m9-13.5v9L12 21.75\"/></svg>\n      </div>\n      <p style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 28px; font-weight: 800; margin: 0; line-height: 1;\">00 - 4</p>\n      <p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1px; text-transform: uppercase; margin: 12px 0 14px;\">Size Options</p>\n      <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.55; margin: 0;\">Six standard capsule sizes from 00 (largest, ~1000mg fill) to size 4 (smallest, ~210mg fill). Choose based on your formulation and target audience.</p>\n    </div><div style=\"background: white; padding: 32px 26px; border-radius: 8px; border-top: 4px solid #012638;\">\n      <div style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 56px; height: 56px; background: #c9dbe2; border-radius: 12px; margin: 0 0 18px;\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#012638\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width:28px;height:28px;\"><path d=\"M8.59 12.41a6 6 0 0 1 8.49-8.49l-1.06 1.06m-4.94 11.42L8.59 12.41m6.36 6.36-3.32-3.32m-1.4-1.4a6 6 0 0 0-3.74 1.43A6 6 0 0 0 4 21l1.5-1.5m11.13-11.13L21 4\"/></svg>\n      </div>\n      <p style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 28px; font-weight: 800; margin: 0; line-height: 1;\">2</p>\n      <p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1px; text-transform: uppercase; margin: 12px 0 14px;\">Material Options</p>\n      <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.55; margin: 0;\">Hard-shell bovine gelatin (most common, lowest cost) or HPMC vegetarian capsules (plant-based, kosher, halal compatible). Pick what fits your brand positioning.</p>\n    </div><div style=\"background: white; padding: 32px 26px; border-radius: 8px; border-top: 4px solid #012638;\">\n      <div style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 56px; height: 56px; background: #c9dbe2; border-radius: 12px; margin: 0 0 18px;\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#012638\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width:28px;height:28px;\"><path d=\"M9.75 3.1v5.66m4.5-5.66v5.66m-4.5 0a3.38 3.38 0 0 1-1.5 6.43m6-6.43a3.38 3.38 0 0 0 1.5 6.43M4.5 19.5a4.5 4.5 0 0 0 4.5 4.5h6a4.5 4.5 0 0 0 4.5-4.5v-4.31a4.5 4.5 0 0 0-4.5-4.5h-6a4.5 4.5 0 0 0-4.5 4.5v4.31Z\"/></svg>\n      </div>\n      <p style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 28px; font-weight: 800; margin: 0; line-height: 1;\">210mg - 1000mg</p>\n      <p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1px; text-transform: uppercase; margin: 12px 0 14px;\">Fill Capacity</p>\n      <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.55; margin: 0;\">Fill range depends on capsule size and ingredient density. Our formulators help right-size the capsule to dosing requirements and customer experience.</p>\n    </div><div style=\"background: white; padding: 32px 26px; border-radius: 8px; border-top: 4px solid #012638;\">\n      <div style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 56px; height: 56px; background: #c9dbe2; border-radius: 12px; margin: 0 0 18px;\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#012638\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width:28px;height:28px;\"><path d=\"M12 3v17.25m0 0a47.78 47.78 0 0 1 3.83.15M12 20.25a47.78 47.78 0 0 0-3.83.15M9.16 8.34h5.66c1.04 0 2 .49 2.62 1.33L21 14.25H3l3.55-4.58a3.31 3.31 0 0 1 2.62-1.33ZM12 8.25c0-2.07-1.7-3.75-3.75-3.75m11.25 3.75c0-2.07-1.7-3.75-3.75-3.75\"/></svg>\n      </div>\n      <p style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 28px; font-weight: 800; margin: 0; line-height: 1;\">Low MOQ</p>\n      <p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1px; text-transform: uppercase; margin: 12px 0 14px;\">Minimums & Set-Up</p>\n      <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.55; margin: 0;\">Low order minimums and no set-up fees. Exact MOQ varies by formulation complexity and is scoped during the discovery call.</p>\n    </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>"},"id":216207156883,"type":"rich_text"},{"body":{"html":"<div style=\"background: #012638; color: white; padding: 90px 20px;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 60px; align-items: center;\">\n    <div><img src=\"https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/private-label/DV_PL_AS_Capsules.jpg\" alt=\"Capsules manufacturing\" style=\"width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 6px;\"/></div><div>\n      <p style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 2px; margin: 0 0 14px;\">MANUFACTURING</p>\n      <h2 style=\"font-size: 32px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.2; margin: 0 0 20px;\">How we manufacture capsules for private label.</h2>\n      <p style=\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.65; opacity: .9; margin: 0;\">Our encapsulation lines run in our FDA-registered Vermont facility under full GMP controls. Every batch goes through identity verification on raw materials, in-process fill weight checks, and finished-product testing for identity, purity, potency, and contaminants before release. Bottling, induction sealing, and labeling happen on the same site, so your private label product ships customer-ready without a third-party packaging handoff.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>"},"id":216207156884,"type":"rich_text"},{"body":{"html":"<div style=\"background: #c9dbe2; padding: 50px 20px; text-align: center;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n    <p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 19px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 22px;\">Want to see capsules samples or talk through your formulation?</p>\n    <a href=\"#get-started\" style=\"display: inline-block; background: #012638; color: white; padding: 14px 32px; text-decoration: none; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; border-radius: 4px; letter-spacing: .5px;\">Request Samples</a>\n  </div>\n</div>"},"id":216207156885,"type":"rich_text"},{"body":{"html":"<div style=\"background: #f7f7f6; padding: 80px 20px;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n    <h2 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 32px; font-weight: 700; text-align: center; margin: 0 0 16px;\">Categories where capsules shine</h2>\n    <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 17px; text-align: center; max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto 48px;\">Some health categories work better in capsules than others. Here are the ones where this format is the natural choice.</p>\n    <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(180px, 1fr)); gap: 24px;\">\n      <a href=\"/private-label-aging\" style=\"display: block; text-decoration: none;\">\n      <div style=\"background: white; border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(1,38,56,.08);\">\n        <img src=\"https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/private-label/agingsupps.png\" alt=\"Aging\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 160px; object-fit: cover; display: block;\"/>\n        <div style=\"padding: 18px 20px; text-align: center;\">\n          <p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0;\">Aging</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </a><a href=\"/private-label-herbal\" style=\"display: block; text-decoration: none;\">\n      <div style=\"background: white; border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(1,38,56,.08);\">\n        <img src=\"https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/private-label/herbalsupps.png\" alt=\"Herbal\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 160px; object-fit: cover; display: block;\"/>\n        <div style=\"padding: 18px 20px; text-align: center;\">\n          <p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0;\">Herbal</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </a><a href=\"/private-label-probiotics\" style=\"display: block; text-decoration: none;\">\n      <div style=\"background: white; border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(1,38,56,.08);\">\n        <img src=\"https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/private-label/probioticsupps.png\" alt=\"Probiotics\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 160px; object-fit: cover; display: block;\"/>\n        <div style=\"padding: 18px 20px; text-align: center;\">\n          <p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0;\">Probiotics</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </a><a href=\"/private-label-womens-health\" style=\"display: block; text-decoration: none;\">\n      <div style=\"background: white; border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(1,38,56,.08);\">\n        <img src=\"https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/private-label/womenssupps.png\" alt=\"Women's Health\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 160px; object-fit: cover; display: block;\"/>\n        <div style=\"padding: 18px 20px; text-align: center;\">\n          <p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0;\">Women's Health</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </a><a href=\"/private-label-sleep\" style=\"display: block; text-decoration: none;\">\n      <div style=\"background: white; border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(1,38,56,.08);\">\n        <img src=\"https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/private-label/sleepsupps.png\" alt=\"Sleep\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 160px; object-fit: cover; display: block;\"/>\n        <div style=\"padding: 18px 20px; text-align: center;\">\n          <p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0;\">Sleep</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>"},"id":216207156886,"type":"rich_text"},{"body":{"html":"<div style=\"background: white; padding: 80px 20px;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 820px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n    <h2 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 32px; font-weight: 700; text-align: center; margin: 0 0 16px;\">Capsules questions we hear most often</h2>\n    <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 17px; text-align: center; margin: 0 0 44px;\">Quick answers to the questions brand owners ask before they commit.</p>\n    <details style=\"background: white; border-radius: 6px; padding: 0; margin: 0 0 14px; border: 1px solid #e6e5e3; box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(1,38,56,.04);\">\n      <summary style=\"cursor: pointer; padding: 22px 28px; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; color: #012638; list-style: none; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;\">\n        <span>Do you offer vegetarian capsules?</span>\n        <span style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; flex-shrink: 0; margin-left: 16px;\">+</span>\n      </summary>\n      <div style=\"padding: 0 28px 24px; color: #444; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65;\">Yes. HPMC (hydroxypropyl methylcellulose) vegetarian capsules are available across all our standard sizes. They are plant-derived, kosher, and halal compatible. Cost is slightly higher than gelatin but most brands targeting health-conscious audiences choose vegetarian as a default.</div>\n    </details><details style=\"background: white; border-radius: 6px; padding: 0; margin: 0 0 14px; border: 1px solid #e6e5e3; box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(1,38,56,.04);\">\n      <summary style=\"cursor: pointer; padding: 22px 28px; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; color: #012638; list-style: none; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;\">\n        <span>What are common allergens to watch for in capsules?</span>\n        <span style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; flex-shrink: 0; margin-left: 16px;\">+</span>\n      </summary>\n      <div style=\"padding: 0 28px 24px; color: #444; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65;\">Standard gelatin capsules are derived from bovine sources, so they are not appropriate for vegetarian or kosher/halal positioning unless verified. HPMC capsules avoid this entirely. Both formats can be manufactured allergen-free for the top common allergens (soy, dairy, wheat, etc.) with proper segregation, which is part of our standard GMP practice.</div>\n    </details><details style=\"background: white; border-radius: 6px; padding: 0; margin: 0 0 14px; border: 1px solid #e6e5e3; box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(1,38,56,.04);\">\n      <summary style=\"cursor: pointer; padding: 22px 28px; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; color: #012638; list-style: none; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;\">\n        <span>What is the typical shelf life of a private label capsule product?</span>\n        <span style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; flex-shrink: 0; margin-left: 16px;\">+</span>\n      </summary>\n      <div style=\"padding: 0 28px 24px; color: #444; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65;\">Most capsule formulations have a 24-month shelf life from manufacture date when stored under standard conditions. Specific shelf life depends on the active ingredients. Stability testing for longer claims (36 months) is available on request.</div>\n    </details><details style=\"background: white; border-radius: 6px; padding: 0; margin: 0 0 14px; border: 1px solid #e6e5e3; box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(1,38,56,.04);\">\n      <summary style=\"cursor: pointer; padding: 22px 28px; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; color: #012638; list-style: none; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;\">\n        <span>Can you do controlled-release or delayed-release capsules?</span>\n        <span style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; flex-shrink: 0; margin-left: 16px;\">+</span>\n      </summary>\n      <div style=\"padding: 0 28px 24px; color: #444; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65;\">Yes. We offer delayed-release (enteric-coated) capsules for ingredients that need to bypass stomach acid, and controlled-release formats for ingredients where extended absorption matters. These are scoped during the formulation phase based on the specific actives.</div>\n    </details><details style=\"background: white; border-radius: 6px; padding: 0; margin: 0 0 14px; border: 1px solid #e6e5e3; box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(1,38,56,.04);\">\n      <summary style=\"cursor: pointer; padding: 22px 28px; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; color: #012638; list-style: none; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;\">\n        <span>What color and printing options are available for capsules?</span>\n        <span style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; flex-shrink: 0; margin-left: 16px;\">+</span>\n      </summary>\n      <div style=\"padding: 0 28px 24px; color: #444; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65;\">Both gelatin and HPMC capsules come in a wide range of colors, including clear, opaque, and two-tone combinations. Capsule printing (brand name or logo directly on the capsule) is available for orders above our standard run minimum. Talk to our team about your brand requirements.</div>\n    </details>\n  </div>\n</div>"},"id":216207156887,"type":"rich_text"},{"body":{"html":"<div style=\"background: #f7f7f6; padding: 80px 20px;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n    <h2 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 32px; font-weight: 700; text-align: center; margin: 0 0 16px;\">Other supplement forms we offer</h2>\n    <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 17px; text-align: center; max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto 48px;\">Most brands launch with two or three formats to give customers options. Here is the full list of formats we manufacture.</p>\n    <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(160px, 1fr)); gap: 36px 24px;\">\n      <div style=\"text-align: center;\">\n      <img src=\"https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/private-label/DV_PL_AS_Tablets.jpg\" alt=\"Tablets\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 180px; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; margin: 0 0 14px;\"/>\n      <p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; margin: 0;\">Tablets</p>\n    </div><div style=\"text-align: center;\">\n      <img src=\"https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/private-label/DV_PL_AS_SoftGel.jpg\" alt=\"Soft Gels\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 180px; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; margin: 0 0 14px;\"/>\n      <p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; margin: 0;\">Soft Gels</p>\n    </div><div style=\"text-align: center;\">\n      <img src=\"https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/private-label/DV_PL_AS_Powders.jpg\" alt=\"Powders\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 180px; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; margin: 0 0 14px;\"/>\n      <p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; margin: 0;\">Powders</p>\n    </div><div style=\"text-align: center;\">\n      <img src=\"https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/private-label/DV_PL_AS_ChewableTablet.jpg\" alt=\"Chewables\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 180px; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; margin: 0 0 14px;\"/>\n      <p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; margin: 0;\">Chewables</p>\n    </div><div style=\"text-align: center;\">\n      <img src=\"https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/private-label/DV_PL_AS_Liquid.jpg\" alt=\"Liquids\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 180px; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; margin: 0 0 14px;\"/>\n      <p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; margin: 0;\">Liquids</p>\n    </div><div style=\"text-align: center;\">\n      <img src=\"https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/private-label/DV_PL_AS_Spray.jpg\" alt=\"Oral Sprays\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 180px; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; margin: 0 0 14px;\"/>\n      <p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; margin: 0;\">Oral Sprays</p>\n    </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>"},"id":216207156888,"type":"rich_text"},{"body":{"html":"<div style=\"background: #f7f7f6; padding: 20px 20px 70px; text-align: center;\">\n  <p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 17px; margin: 0;\">\n    Looking for the complete catalog of available formulations?\n    <a href=\"https://www.davincilabs.com/product-guide\" style=\"color: #6BA644; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; margin-left: 6px;\">Explore the Product Guide &rarr;</a>\n  </p>\n</div>"},"id":216207156889,"type":"rich_text"},{"body":{"html":"<div id=\"get-started\" style=\"background: #e6e5e3; padding: 80px 20px; text-align: center;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n    <h2 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 32px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.25; margin: 0 0 16px;\">Ready to launch your supplement line in capsules?</h2>\n    <p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.55; margin: 0 0 32px;\">Schedule a consultation and we will walk through formulation options, packaging, branding, and the timeline. Most brands launch within 3 to 4 weeks of approving labels, 8 to 12 weeks from first conversation.</p>\n    <a href=\"#get-started\" style=\"display: inline-block; background: #6BA644; color: white; padding: 16px 40px; text-decoration: none; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; border-radius: 4px; letter-spacing: .5px;\">Schedule a Consultation</a>\n  </div>\n</div>"},"id":216207156890,"type":"rich_text"},{"body":{"html":"<div style=\"background: white; padding: 90px 20px;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.2fr; gap: 56px; align-items: center;\">\n    <div>\n      <img src=\"https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/private-label/Private%20Label%20Guide%20ToF.jpg\" alt=\"The Definitive Guide to Private Labeling Supplements\" style=\"width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(1,38,56,.15);\"/>\n    </div>\n    <div>\n      <p style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 2px; margin: 0 0 14px;\">NEW TO PRIVATE LABEL</p>\n      <h2 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 32px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.2; margin: 0 0 20px;\">Get the free Definitive Guide to Private Labeling</h2>\n      <p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 28px;\">If you are new to private labeling supplements and want to learn more about how to build your brand with our manufacturing team, download our free Definitive Guide. You will get answers to the most frequently asked questions about private labeling, plus tips and step-by-step instructions to make your new product launch easy, successful, and profitable.</p>\n      <a href=\"/guide-definitive-private-label\" style=\"display: inline-block; background: #6BA644; color: white; padding: 14px 32px; text-decoration: none; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; border-radius: 4px; letter-spacing: .5px;\">Download the Guide</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>"},"id":216207156891,"type":"rich_text"},{"body":{"html":"<div style=\"background: #e6e5e3; padding: 90px 20px;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center;\">\n    <p style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 2px; margin: 0 0 14px;\">50+ YEARS OF SUPPLEMENT MANUFACTURING</p>\n    <h2 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 34px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.2; margin: 0 0 24px;\">Developed by us. Made for you.</h2>\n    <p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 18px;\">With over 50 years in the health supplement industry, we are one of the most trusted dietary supplement manufacturers. Every private label supplement we produce is doctor-formulated using thoroughly researched ingredients, then scientifically reviewed for efficacy and quality before it ever enters production in our U.S. facilities.</p>\n    <p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 18px;\">FoodScience is an FDA-registered food facility, GMP certified to SQF food safety standards, and certified to NSF GMP 455-2.</p>\n    <p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 40px;\">When you partner with us, our expert team is with you every step of the way. Help your customers find what they want from a source they trust. You.</p>\n    <div style=\"display: flex; gap: 50px; justify-content: center; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n      <img src=\"https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/private-label/DV_PL_Logo_SQF.png\" alt=\"SQF Certified\" style=\"height: 80px; width: auto;\"/>\n      <img src=\"https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/private-label/NSF.png\" alt=\"NSF GMP Certified\" style=\"height: 80px; width: auto;\"/>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>"},"id":216207156892,"type":"rich_text"},{"body":{"html":"<div style=\"background: #012638; padding: 28px 24px; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center;\">\n    <p style=\"color: rgba(255,255,255,.78); font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0; letter-spacing: .2px;\">\n      These statements have not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration. These products are not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease. Information on this site is provided for informational purposes only and is not intended as a substitute for advice from your physician or other health care professional.\n    </p>\n  </div>\n</div>"},"id":216207156893,"type":"rich_text"}]}},"widgets":{}}